  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the region for the given inequalities&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, we get</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/70d39a46-cc4e-47bb-9532-992ada09025e-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 162px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Required area will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>28</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
